(text "Isolation barrier (user rulings 2026-10-05 / 2026-10-07; dual-SPI 2026-11-14): the application processor (AP) is its own ground domain (GND_AP, VAP_IO). Everything that crosses to the FPGA/analog side goes through isolators: U501 MAX22445C = XMOS control SPI (XMOS_SPI_* -> SPI_XMOS_*), U502 MAX22445F = I2S with the FPGA as master (BCLK/LRCLK FPGA->AP + FPGA_IRQ_N, SDATA AP->FPGA; sides swapped), U503 MAX22444C = AP reset -> EXT_RST_N + ch2 AP_I2S_DATA2 -> I2S_DATA2 (AP McASP0 second I2S source, 2026-11-20; +2 spare fwd), U504 ISO1640 = I2C to the four TMP117 (sensor bus on the FPGA/analog side, V33D = ISO1640 side 1; AP = side 2, VAP_IO >= 2.25 V). U509 MAX22445C = host-AP SPI (AP_SPI_* -> SPI_AP_*): second independent SPI slave port - the AP SoM has direct FPGA register access alongside the XMOS (per-port write ACL in RTL; XMOS = audio-path subset). U513 MAX22445F = SPI_AP_IRQ_N FPGA->AP (sides swapped like U502). FPGA side of the MAX2244x = V18 (1.71 V capable; ISO77xx were not - 2026-10-09). Conn1/J506 is the PCIe x16 card-edge site (user riser PCB, 2026-11-16): west edge, closest to FPGA, main-board bottom. VAP_IO/GND_AP serve the AP and AP-side isolator supplies; V33_IF_IN/GND feed the separate carrier-side 1.8 V LDO. Conn1 side A carries 20 V12SOM contacts + GND returns; side B is the AP domain. J507/J508 are removed. SOM_PG is included but still needs an isolation-path review. SPI: 10 MHz standard-timed guaranteed, 50 MHz with AP RX sample delay (bom 21)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.000 17.000 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "0032172f-dafb-4cf3-a943-b815ee897ab1"))
(text "Conn1 power allocation (PCIe x16 side A): 20 x V12SOM (A1-A20) plus GND returns A21-A56/A61-A82; 4 x V33_IF_IN (A57-A60) inside the GND return field. V33_IF_IN is distinct from VAP_IO/GND_AP. Local 1.8 V LDO MPN/output wiring remains to be added." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.000 31.000 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "b3da1994-6e28-4f80-adea-bd50d292e1d2"))
(text "TMP117 placement (bom 20, 4 so far): U505 L cascode/replica array, U506 R cascode/replica array, U507 R_off/Rpad heat zone, U508 clock XO area. V33D = digital 3.3 V (power sheet, PWR_FLAG here). ALERT pins unused. Pull-ups 2.2k each side of the ISO1640." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.000 24.000 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "7b79dacb-792e-4d9e-a7c3-3add7a99252a"))
(symbol (lib_id "bfdac:PCIe_x16") (at 39.370 59.690 0) (unit 1) (exclude_from_sim no) (in_bom yes) (on_board yes) (dnp no) (uuid "d121cd0b-220d-4ff3-a157-24bef3d86f43") (property "Reference" "J506" (at 42.370 58.390 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left))) (property "Value" "AP DIG + PWR" (at 42.370 60.990 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left))) (property "Footprint" "bfdac:PCIe_x16_Amphenol_10165968" (at 39.370 59.690 0) (hide yes) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)))) (property "Datasheet" "" (at 39.370 59.690 0) (hide yes) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)))) (property "Description" "Amphenol PCIe x16 Gen6 vertical SMT card-edge socket, 164 pos (2x82) @1.0mm, 1.57mm card, 11.25mm above board, solder-retention hold-downs. Conn1/J506<->J7705 AP digital + power link; riser = user PCB with card-edge fingers both ends (SEAF-40/SEAR-40 struck 2026-11-16 - SEAR not purchasable). Side A = carrier power (V12SOM x20, GND, V33_IF_IN), side B = AP domain (signals, VAP_IO, GND_AP) per docs/PCIE_PIN_ASSIGNMENTS.md. Land = PCIe_x16_Amphenol_10165968 (SnapEDA-verified Amphenol drawing). West edge closest to FPGA, B.Cu." (at 39.370 59.690 0) (hide yes) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)))) (property "MPN" "10165968-113Y000LF" (at 39.370 59.690 0) (hide yes) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)))) (pin "A1" (uuid "ef221326-4f62-4205-b270-17f71835d9ce")) (pin "A2" (uuid "3ebd59b7-ec52-418c-b237-9e26672b336b")) (pin "A3" (uuid "c73cfc7a-395f-44f8-ba42-cb3d65350e42")) (pin "A4" (uuid "0447afb4-cb47-48e2-96b8-9ad6172443f1")) (pin "A5" (uuid "6919affe-9f8a-40ca-b730-844e6f5fef13")) (pin "A6" (uuid "6ba6850c-a5e7-4f3b-9a21-59b7ee85ed58")) (pin "A7" (uuid "fd42e833-05da-445a-9b2a-f32c51cd852f")) (pin "A8" (uuid "9809e843-0abf-49a6-bf3c-1c4824604c95")) (pin "A9" (uuid "d497f22d-04f6-47d9-aa17-d9d32e3fe445")) (pin "A10" (uuid "7e646f7a-341e-4dec-a2cc-2f9479005b10")) (pin "A11" (uuid "53844705-20b8-43f9-865c-b122a2315585")) (pin "A12" (uuid "47a84a2e-23e5-4048-9b5b-44f73ee7efc6"