(text "RLY_LINE_MUTE (J1-A13 / E4) terminates on the OUT sheet (bom 7): U602 AND gate with FPGA_DONE and PG_ALL -> UNMUTE_EN -> U601 ULN2003V12 inputs AND U603 TPS7A2033 EN (V33RLY coil rail). relay_level[1:0] struck (digital level); pins reused for SPI_AP_IRQ_N/PG_ALL. relay_hp_mute/hp_rails removed 2026-11-14 (no headphone stage)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 230.000 130.000 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "b06f3228-37f5-4ca1-935b-6138937e5049"))
(text "V33D = U512 TPS7A2033 from V4P3_LB (always on; bom 17n: housekeeping branch, also feeds P5A_R): TMP117 x4 + ISO1640 side 1 + UCD90120A x2 + LEDs, ~120 mA." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.000 235.000 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "0ac4d963-0db3-4724-a90c-970045010eb9"))
